        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Nigel's cloudy eyes close... Noctis has won the fight, one where Nigel himself has given his all and fought in all the ways he knows."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Noctis has visualized fights where he has defeated Nigel more times than he cares to admit—and yet, with Nigel lying defeated in front of him now, Noctis seems to have difficulty wrapping his head around what's happened."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noctis",
            "Nigel... why? What's all this for?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Noctis remembers having asked this question before—still, he hopes to hear a different answer from this man who was once a dear friend."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noctis",
